# Converts a shortcut string from editor notation (Cmnd+Shift+X) to Queue notation (Com-Shift-X).
# pEditorString = shortcut as shown/stored in the editor.
# Returns the Queue keyboard event string, or '' if it can't be parsed.
Calculate code as $cinst.$shortcutTextToCode(pEditorString) ## string → numeric code
If isclear(code)
	Quit method ''
End If
Quit method $cinst.$shortcutCodeToText(code,kFalse) ## code → Queue string (pEditMode=kFalse)